OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABlasts heard as US Army carries out
OL,4,Acontrolled detonation of degraded
OL,5,Aexplosives in Iowa
OL,6,
OL,7,FSmoke can be seen rising into the sky
OL,8,Fafter the US Army detonates five tonnes
OL,9,Fof degraded explosives in Middletown,
OL,10,FIowa
OL,12,FDual explosions could be heard shortly
OL,13,Fafter 09:00 local time (15:00 GMT) -
OL,14,Fofficials say the blast "exceeded all
OL,15,Fexpectations", according to the BBC's
OL,16,FUS partner CBS News
OL,18,FThe controlled detonation of 68 barrels
OL,19,Fof lead azide - a highly volatile
OL,20,Fcompound - was necessary to prevent an
OL,21,Funplanned explosion, the Army says
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
