OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1795623988
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABlasts heard as US Army carries out
OL,4,Acontrolled detonation of degraded
OL,5,Aexplosives in Iowa
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt also warned locals of "potential
OL,8,Fexposure to toxic lead dust" - an
OL,9,Foptional evacuation zone and a shelter
OL,10,Fin place advisory were among the
OL,11,Fmeasures in place
OL,13,FSome residents living just eight miles
OL,14,F(12km) away say they did not "hear a
OL,15,Fthing", while others in the area report
OL,16,Fit sounding "like something huge just
OL,17,Fexploded"
OL,19,FOver in neighbouring Missouri, the
OL,20,Fgovernor says initial analysis suggests
OL,21,F"mitigation measures appear to have
OL,22,Fbeen successful"
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
